{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walking the line between right and wrong is never easy\u2014especially when you're broke, burnt out, and chasing a dream you can barely hold onto. After walking away from a lucrative corporate job to develop your own romantic visual novel, you're now struggling to finish the project while keeping your life from falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an indie developer with no funding, no studio, and no backup plan, you must rely on the people around you\u2014not just for emotional support, but to help fill the gaps in your project: music, art, marketing, everything. But leaning on friends comes with a price. Can you ask for help without crossing boundaries? And what are you willing to give in return?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll form deep, evolving relationships with four women whose lives become increasingly entwined with yours:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sonia</strong> \u2013 Your best friend\u2019s wife. Irresistible, unpredictable, and dangerously close.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chloe</strong> \u2013 Your childhood friend and emotional anchor. Loyal, sharp, and maybe harboring feelings of her own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lalana</strong> \u2013 Your flirty neighbor with a teasing smile and an open heart\u2014though her connection to Chloe complicates things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erica</strong> \u2013 Your seductive, enigmatic dentist. She knows how to push your buttons... and cross your boundaries.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision you make will shape your story\u2014from emotional bonds to moral choices, from comfort to betrayal. Will you stay loyal to John and finally cut ties with Sonia? Pursue something honest with Chloe? Surrender to Lalana\u2019s bold advances and fall into an unexpected power game? Or explore the dark, enticing depths of Erica\u2019s twisted affection?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/d8e04518bbfbb22ab3fa956d77e6d547.poster.avif?t=1773216854\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/d8e04518bbfbb22ab3fa956d77e6d547.webm?t=1773216854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/d8e04518bbfbb22ab3fa956d77e6d547.mp4?t=1773216854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A choice-driven visual novel</strong> with branching dialogue, emotional weight, and seductive tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erotic, story-integrated sex scenes</strong>\u2014never gratuitous, always meaningful</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No grinding, no stat management</strong>\u2014just pure, story-focused gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character relationships</strong> built through comfort, trust, manipulation\u2026 or desire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional mini-games and coding segments</strong> tied to Daniel\u2019s development struggles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive sound and atmosphere</strong>, with a cinematic approach to pacing and tone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/efd2c0abcc035373d1b3e4bb3394e34b.poster.avif?t=1773216854\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/efd2c0abcc035373d1b3e4bb3394e34b.webm?t=1773216854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/efd2c0abcc035373d1b3e4bb3394e34b.mp4?t=1773216854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Next-Gen Visual Experience:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a major step forward from anything we\u2019ve built before.<br>Enjoy <strong> 2K visuals</strong>, <strong>high-resolution custom character models</strong>, and <strong>beautifully detailed locations</strong> crafted to heighten immersion. Every scene uses dynamic camera angles and cinematic composition to pull you directly into the protagonist\u2019s perspective - making each choice, kiss, and confrontation feel undeniably real.<br><br>Experience <strong>sex scenes animations</strong> like never before - brought to life with our cutting-edge rendering techniques. Enjoy breathtaking fluidity, multiple dynamic camera angles, and an unprecedented level of realism that builds unbearable erotic tension with every moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/2bf026bd93fd4dd38a97330506e251c8.poster.avif?t=1773216854\" width=1170 height=666 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/2bf026bd93fd4dd38a97330506e251c8.webm?t=1773216854\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354190/extras/2bf026bd93fd4dd38a97330506e251c8.mp4?t=1773216854\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to finish the game of your dreams\u2014without losing yourself in the process? Or will romance.exe crash under the weight of your desires?</strong></p>"